  "ingredients": [
    "3 stalks celery stalks, cut in thirds",
    "3 turkey legs",
    "6 tablespoons butter",
    "salt to taste",
    "0.5 cup water, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YKBkzDQqeojnJdo8Qhed2lJgMt0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84456-roasted-turkey-legs-ddmfs-step1-4x3-0042-897abf6e9ae848e284a799fc394069f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84456/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Rinse turkey legs and pat dry.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stand turkey legs upright (as if the turkey were standing). Press a knife downward into the deep tissue, creating 2 or 3 long pockets. Press a piece of celery into each opening. Pull back the skin on the legs, rub with butter, and season with a little salt. Put the skin back into place, rub with more butter, and season lightly with salt. Lay the turkey legs in a roasting pan. Pour in water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pc_chOtED7Hs5a85TIb4apbiHKY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84456-roasted-turkey-legs-ddmfs-step2-4x3-0044-52d999fd7a2344378c4ac86ad1a0571c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84456/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast uncovered until the legs are golden brown and the internal temperature is 180 degrees F (82 degrees C) when taken with a meat thermometer, about 1 ½ to 2 hours. Add more water if needed while roasting, and baste occasionally with the juices or melted butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VQ0bDh8hUbRzlPhRvgoOkRZz3LU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84456-roasted-turkey-legs-ddmfs-step3-4x3-0089-d11cb3d0e24349ddbcdc18bd0530ec76.jpg"
